{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>חָשַׁע</b> — refrain from me, like: שְׁעוּ מִנִּי (Job 14:6). The vowel changed because of the guttural letter." "<b>ואבליגה</b> — and I grow strong. It is a transitive verb, and its meaning is: I strengthen myself, like: מְבַלִּיגִיתִי."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:20.617130968Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}